{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:51:21+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:51:21+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Solvay SA","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Chemicals","country":"Belgium","city":"Brussels","website":"https://www.solvay.com","employees":8400,"summary":"Solvay SA provides basic and performance chemicals worldwide. The company engages in the production of sodium carbonate or soda ash and its derivatives used by customers in glass for building, solar panels, glass containers, and packaging; in lithium-ion batteries for electric vehicles; and for detergents and chemicals, as well as sodium bicarbonate for food and animal feed, and flue gas treatment or healthcare applications. It also offers hydrogen peroxide for use in bleaching, decontamination, disinfection, and antiseptic applications in the pulp and paper, textile, water, and food industries; and as an intermediate to produce propylene oxide and caprolactam chemicals, as well as used in semiconductors, photovoltaic, urban mining, and battery sectors. In addition, the company provides precipitated silica, a component in applications in the tire, home and personal care, and feed and food industries; highly dispersible silica used in various tire parts; and oxygenated solvents and polyamides for use in paintings, hygiene, and home care applications, as well as for the production of phenol and derivatives used as intermediates to produce synthetic resins in foundries, construction, and abrasives. Further, it produces fluorine and rare-earth formulations for automotive, electronics, and various chemical and industrial applications. The company was founded in 1863 and is headquartered in Brussels, Belgium.","exchange":"Brussels","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Solvay SA fournit des produits chimiques de base et de performance dans le monde entier. La société se consacre à la production de carbonate de sodium ou de soude et de ses dérivés utilisés par les clients dans le verre pour la construction, les panneaux solaires, les récipients en verre et les emballages; dans les batteries lithium-ion pour les véhicules électriques; et pour les détergents et les produits chimiques, ainsi que le bicarbonate de sodium pour l'alimentation humaine et animale, et le traitement des gaz de combustion ou des applications de soins de santé. Il offre également du peroxyde d'hydrogène pour une utilisation dans le blanchiment, la décontamination, la désinfection et les applications antiseptiques dans les industries des pâtes et papiers, du textile, de l'eau et de l'alimentation; et comme intermédiaire pour produire de l'oxyde de propylène et des produits chimiques à base de caprolactame, ainsi que dans les secteurs des semi-conducteurs, du photovoltaïque, des mines urbaines et des batteries."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":2488665344,"shares_outstanding":104477978,"trailing_pe":794.0,"forward_pe":10.084803,"price_to_book":2.3853395,"ev_to_ebitda":7.524,"ev_to_revenue":0.966,"dividend_yield":0.1024,"payout_ratio":81.0,"beta_yahoo":0.255},"targets":{"current_price":23.82,"mean":24.07333,"median":24.5,"high":28.5,"low":20.0,"n_analysts":15,"reco_mean":3.53333,"reco_key":"underperform"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-04"],"eps_avg":0.45,"eps_low":0.41,"eps_high":0.49,"revenue_avg":1086000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-18","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.3081,"institutions_pct":0.22726,"institutions_float_pct":0.32846,"institutions_n":122,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0015,"shares":156672,"value":3731926,"date":"2024-03-31","chg":0.1508}],"funds":[{"name":"American Century ETF Trust-Avantis International Small Cap Value ETF","pct":0.0165,"shares":1747239,"value":41619232,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":-0.0156},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0099,"share